{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c28a0e320211728cce27a88b3a49c620e4e639d81e211f5294e71635e28ffea3", "ja": "（新年ライブのステージが、無事終了した。\n新年早々、いいスタートが切れたな……！）", "zh": "（新年演唱会的舞台顺利结束了。新年伊始就有了个不错的开端啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "94afa1a4181b7e6bb4055e5df4d26559e5acb66fba7f5cce8588a542c0474265", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\n今日のライブも、楽しかったですね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦！\n今天的演出也很开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1002_p", "source_sha256": "664123bb1ab6a83a54f0932a0b6c0eaf9a7b62151de5ef39ee153ef5c407916b", "ja": "お疲れさま、未来。\n未来も、よく頑張ったな！", "zh": "辛苦了，未来。\n你今天也很努力啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "1b040acf121b60edba1fae596d9acaafdad6fae44022a551a125ae02c6ea7cd5", "ja": "はい！　今日のライブ、覚えることがたくさんあって。\nリハーサルでは、間違えちゃったんですけど……。", "zh": "是的！今天的演唱会要记的东西很多。  \n彩排的时候，我还出错了……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "733e4eadf5068a46e80691c5f256954da55660aa28c743685e26f5844f3316aa", "ja": "本番では、一回も間違えませんでした！\nでへへ……♪", "zh": "正式演出时一次都没出错！  \n嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "738950cdbcda10f8c31629ab78c827d969093984731c359495b66291f8f9f2c7", "ja": "きっと前に、{$P$}さんと\nお参りした時に買った、お守りのおかげだと思います！", "zh": "我想一定是因为之前和{$P$}先生一起  \n去参拜时买的护身符吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1006_p", "source_sha256": "26252c32d0c9d22863056d27a6d4d923d09bbd0bf18d8dcb9bd333572d986665", "ja": "へえ、そうだったのか。もしかして未来、\nステージでも、ずっとお守りを持っていたのか？", "zh": "哦，原来是这样啊。难道说，未来你在舞台上也一直带着护身符吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "968b2d797db003a921e302c4feaa73b876b1559ab1dbbc78597c95b12ddd7149", "ja": "はい、衣装のポケットに入れておきましたから！\n学校に行く時も、毎日持ってるんですよ♪", "zh": "嗯，我一直把它放在演出服的口袋里！\n就连上学的时候，我也每天都带着它哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "fefce844bdb0d18aa97c112ed63a4ad9715fffee0e4475c034b8fd9388d02a2b", "ja": "あ、お風呂に入る時は、置いていきますけど。\nでも、ずっと持ってたほうがいいかなって。", "zh": "啊，不过洗澡的时候还是会放下。\n但我觉得，还是一直带在身上比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a1f34d0ecb0a31c11d37945b92a81715cb2d5ea3dbdd8e6e28b8bf3ff660c941", "ja": "そうか。それだけ大事にしていれば、ご利益が\nありそうだな……神様も喜んでるんじゃないか？", "zh": "这样啊。既然你这么珍惜它，说不定会得到神明的保佑……神明也会很高兴吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "7c54797dd9568117d084ad231ef98783e766f38d5371cb6d4ee7bbaa7a68f47b", "ja": "わぁっ、本当ですか！？　じゃあ、\n私のお願いごとも、叶えてくれるかな……？", "zh": "哇，真的吗！？那神明大人\n也会实现我的愿望吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1011_p", "source_sha256": "886b283d9e5bddc9063252818b8a0c4e38ff4ac85dbf6775af4e96d90fd96f9a", "ja": "お願いごとか……そういえばあの時、熱心に\nお祈りしてたな。何をお願いしたんだ？", "zh": "愿望啊……说起来，那时候你还虔诚地祈祷来着。许了什么愿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "ec50bb4bbd70a40117b774f7c331688a7838dc468541b190260025abd84e536f", "ja": "え？　それは、えっと……。\nやっぱり、一番は……。", "zh": "咦？那个嘛，呃……果然，最重要的还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0474c81f46b4302bf8f2cf6ce6ab5f0aeb9b5f9258267d9f6a130c15b4d8663d", "ja": "え、一番？　じゃあ、二番もあるのか？", "zh": "咦，第一名？那还有第二名吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "9fcf3b2982f00a7b292840a2081077a5b9a218707048d2220e5eaaa05a917972", "ja": "あっ！　えっと、\n一番と二番と三番があるんですけど……。", "zh": "啊！那个，有第一名、第二名和第三名……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "3d1d26d52746ff33f39aba6cf5261e627669f86233639eea1d75e1787c3a31bb", "ja": "やっぱり、恥ずかしいからナイショです！　それに\n話したら、お願いごとが叶わなくなっちゃうかも……。", "zh": "还是算啦，因为太难为情了，要保密！而且\n要是说出来的话，愿望可能就无法实现了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5cca39e84218cc125d9dd76848036feca68fb80af0864e948eb8fff3dd646fbb", "ja": "確かにそうだな……じゃあ、未来のお願いごとが\n無事叶ったら、その時に教えてもらおうかな。", "zh": "说得也是……那么，等未来的心愿\n顺利实现了，到时候再告诉我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "e56114dac7b9e584143e8431d4bd1982ff172e0100cc6ed69b4140a9a3ef4dfe", "ja": "はい！　……あ、でも私、よくばってたくさん\nお願いしちゃったから。すぐには叶わないかも……。", "zh": "好的！……啊，不过我许了好多愿望，有点贪心。所以可能没那么快实现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a1a3739ec08f1c1f0e3a923172d7e8d50d64537c8bdd6a78b5835548583bf941", "ja": "でも、お願いごとなんだし。ちょっとくらい\n欲張ってもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "不过，毕竟是许愿嘛。稍微贪心一点，也没关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "80631dea711ee2d4cc1b955bacc193ffae1b124500be51296a84d349c93d701f", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nえへへ、そうですよね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n嘿嘿，是这样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "7097f5306e000ee08ebaa8d6587765076626f43d40c7064618fe044b2186fd2e", "ja": "じゃあお願いごとが叶ったら、一番に\n{$P$}さんに教えますね！", "zh": "那么，愿望实现后，我会第一时间告诉{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0173_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "421553eaf283849a7cc57af4745a4fd8ea313214957e4d16e4582f531da3eeaf", "ja": "だから私のお願いごとが叶うまで、ずっと、\nずーっとそばにいてくださいね！　約束ですよ♪", "zh": "所以在我的愿望实现之前，请一直、一直陪在我身边哦！说好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
